  "summary_en": "Sweden's 2026 national AI strategy, replacing the 2018 approach. It aims to place Sweden among the world's top ten AI nations, using AI for societal benefit, sustainability and competitiveness. It favours simple, technology-neutral regulation, EU rules simplification, public-sector AI adoption, computing capacity, skills and research. It has no robotics-specific content.",
